Pursuant to Regulation 50(1) of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (as amended) and SEBI''s directions, we hereby inform that a Meeting of the Board of Directors of Hampi Expressways Private Limited ("the Company") is scheduled to be held on Friday, September 11, 2026 inter-alia to consider the following, subject to necessary approvals:
i. Refinancing the existing Non-Convertible Debentures of the Company;
ii. Early ful redemption of Senior, Unsecured, Listed, Rated, Redeemable, Non-Convertible Debentures (NCDs) bearing ISIN: INE03ST08010 issued on August 08, 2023 listed on BSE in accordance with the terms of Debenture Trust Deed (DTD) executed on August 04, 2023.
